@api = http://localhost:5080

### Look up a booking
GET {{api}}/api/bookings/QX7P2L

### Find bookings by last name
GET {{api}}/api/bookings?lastName=Tan

### List change requests
GET {{api}}/api/change-requests

### Create a change request
POST {{api}}/api/change-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingReference": "QX7P2L",
  "currentDate": "2026-11-20",
  "requestedDate": "2026-11-22",
  "note": "Prefer a morning flight",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-29T09:00:00+00:00"
}
